{"id":"662765","name":"自制冰棍","author":"putimama","authorId":"8334261","desc":"","cover":"images/662765/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"酸奶","amount":"1盒"}],"sub":[{"name":"奶粉","amount":"5g"},{"name":"红火龙果粉","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"酸奶一盒。","img":"images/662765/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"奶粉、白糖各5g。","img":"images/662765/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"与酸奶搅拌均匀。","img":"images/662765/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入少许红火龙果粉，与其搅拌均匀。","img":"images/662765/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"搅拌均匀即可。","img":"images/662765/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"将混合好的酸奶过滤一下。","img":"images/662765/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"模具与平行即可，冷冻一会再插冰棍杆。","img":"images/662765/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"这是冷冻了5个小时的冰棍，稍缓一下。","img":"images/662765/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"成功脱膜，颜色漂亮！","img":"images/662765/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"立体感强，过年做一些饭后来一下解解油腻是不错的选择。","img":"images/662765/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"第一次自制冰棍效果不错。","img":"images/662765/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}